    id: 'd36_sc04',
    title: 'Diplomatic Rejection of an Exclusive Vendor Lock-In Agreement',
    context: 'Procurement Director Alok diplomatically declines a multi-year exclusivity clause proposed by Hardware Supplier Greg.',
